Get it? Swing? I really crack myself up sometimes... #emotion:xd
Anyways, a little help here? I got a business meeting in an hour. #emotion:neutral
Ok, maybe not. But still, I'd rather not be stuck up here all day.
*   [Would you look at the time...]
    I really should be getting back to work soon. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none #relation_pts:Emily/-5
    But good luck with... whatever is going on here.
    Oh yeah sure... just leave me here. #speaker:Emily #emotion:annoyed
    I'm sure those plants will absolutely suffer from having to wait an extra thirty seconds.
    Just you wait, *player*. I'm gonna make you regret ever picking this planet as a vacation spot! #speaker:Emily #emotion:angry
    (Knowing Emily, she's completely serious about getting revenge over this) #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    
*   [How'd you mess this up THAT bad?]
    I don't think I've ever seen anyone mess up a prank this badly before. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    I mean... this is stuff you only see in cartoons.
    Yeah yeah... Keep rubbing it in. #speaker:Emily #emotion:neutral
    For what it's worth, this might be my new all-time low. #emotion:happy
    Now if you'd be so kind, I'd really appreciate it if my leg wasn't going numb right now. #emotion:neutral
    
*   [You look real comfortable up there]
    I don't know... you do look real comfortable in that tree. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none #relation_pts:Emily/5
    On second thought, you're right, *player*. #speaker:Emily #emotion:neutral
    If you could grab me a glass of lemonade, I'd be in paradise right now. #emotion:happy
    Of course, milady. Would you also like if I made you some fresh cookies? #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
    Would I? I should make you my full time butler while I have the chance. #speaker:Emily #emotion:xd
    No, but seriously *player*. Please cut me down. The blood's starting to rush to my head. #emotion:neutral
    
-   Fine, I'll help you down. #speaker:*player* #emotion:none
